{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "026N", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{Y}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-equivalent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3957251cb6c882ce5a8cb1bf8adf79ca562c019147a2c50178bf572c8ff3e503", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7db7e81f3f1cd83c0eb083c85ad48b67b519a4e2858c6fe2571adc11e22f7296", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004> be categories over <MATH_0005>.\nAssume <MATH_0006>, <MATH_0007> are equivalent as categories over\n<MATH_0008>. Then <MATH_0009> is an algebraic stack if and\nonly if <MATH_0010> is an algebraic stack. Similarly, <MATH_0011>\nis a Deligne-Mumford stack if and only if <MATH_0012> is a Deligne-Mumford\nstack.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ada001ec72ecfd7d4f1107dbb72627e35512479d4d8eddd0b6ade036dd3dd530", "unit_id": "tag:03YQ:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "026N", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0006": "$2$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]_f \\ar[d]_{\\Delta_\\mathcal{X}} &\n\\mathcal{Y} \\ar[d]^{\\Delta_\\mathcal{Y}} \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} \\times \\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]^{f \\times f} &\n\\mathcal{Y} \\times \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$\\Delta_\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0009": "$U$", "MATH_0010": "$S$", "MATH_0011": "$x : (\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$1$", "MATH_0013": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n(\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\ar[r]_{\\text{id}} \\ar[d]_x &\n(\\Sch/U)_{fppf} \\ar[d]^{f \\circ x} \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]^f &\n\\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0014": "$f \\circ x$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-lemma-stack-in-groupoids-equivalent}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-representable-by-spaces-morphism-equivalent}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-property-morphism-equivalent}", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "SPACE_0003": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2b997fdee488e7f2db07be747e406f37cc6d04c60c6b569bd78fa7b749cff121", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:22f6bc25b0d4eba1e3c749c31efded1bcdea1ff08902e01337d2e0cfb8cf40af", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is an algebraic stack (resp.<SPACE_0001>a Deligne-Mumford stack). By\nStacks, Lemma <REF_0001>\nthis implies that <MATH_0002> is a stack in groupoids over\n<MATH_0003>. Choose an equivalence <MATH_0004>\nover <MATH_0005>. This gives a <MATH_0006>-commutative diagram\n<MATH_0007>\nwhose horizontal arrows are equivalences. This implies that\n<MATH_0008> is representable by algebraic spaces according to\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nFinally, let <MATH_0009> be a scheme over <MATH_0010>, and let\n<MATH_0011> be a <MATH_0012>-morphism which\nis surjective and smooth (resp.<SPACE_0002><ACCENT_0001>tale). Considering the diagram\n<MATH_0013>\nand applying\nLemma <REF_0003>\nwe conclude that <MATH_0014> is surjective and smooth (resp.<SPACE_0003><ACCENT_0002>tale)\nas desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5fd407cbff0083ca7225a61db8a9b58c5516015f387be6f5decade280449f86c", "unit_id": "tag:03YQ:proof"}
